WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.590
Booking policies: booking rules: offered times, cancellation, rescheduling, late arrival and no-shows, holds and reminders. The assistant tells customers these rules and applies them.

2
00:00:15.136 --> 00:00:20.350
Under "Offered times", set how many times are offered and how far ahead.

3
00:00:20.904 --> 00:00:27.240
"Cancellation" and "Rescheduling": how many hours before is free, and what happens after.

4
00:00:27.795 --> 00:00:34.710
Under "Late arrival & no-shows", set the grace time; after it, the booking counts as a no-show.

5
00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:43.460
Under "Reminders", choose reminder times (for example "24 h before" and "2 h before") and save.

6
00:00:44.006 --> 00:00:51.080
Strict rules without a deposit don't help; if no-shows are high, add a deposit to those services.
